      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAESAR.\nGo to him, Dolabella, bid him yield.\nBeing so frustrate, tell him, he mocks\nThe pauses that he makes.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
